# This directory is also a live GitHub Actions runner installation. Ignore
# everything by default, then allow only the portable fleet-kit source.
*

# Default home for generated runner installations.
.runners/

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!security_best_practices_report.md
!fleet.example.tsv

!docs/
